                          "Citation": "NIHEI T, ARAI K, MIURA Y, YAGASAKI K. Arginine as an Exacerbating Factor for Glomerulonephritis in Rats Fed a Methionine-threonine-supplemented Low Casein Diet. Bioscience, Biotechnology, and Biochemistry. 2001 Jan;65(5):1155–62. doi: 10.1271/bbb.65.1155.",
