                          "Citation": "Lock EA, Gaskin P, Ellis MK, Robinson M, Provan WM, Smith LL. The effect of a low-protein diet and dietary supplementation of threonine on tyrosine and 2-(2-nitro-4-trifluoromethylbenzoyl) cyclohexane-1,3-dione-induced corneal lesions, the extent of tyrosinemia, and the activity of enzymes involved in tyrosine catabolism in the rat. Toxicol Appl Pharmacol. 1998 May;150(1):125–32. doi: 10.1006/taap.1998.8404. PMID: 9630461.",
                          "PMID": 9630461,
